file tools/ales_stereo_compress_env_witness.rish the trilingual witness (EN · Radiant · TAME), build + selftest GREEN gate
recommend keep-going — the family is now mechanical: stereo_gate_env, stereo_limit_env, stereo_expand_env each wire the linked envelope into their memoryless stereo rung the same way, single-module, policy written, no seam.
